      "description": "Code lookup search: a sunken well with a magnifier, amber cursor and no outline.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 4a6 6 0 1 1 0 12 6 6 0 0 1 0-12zM15 15l5 5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><input placeholder=\"Code, for example P0171\" aria-label=\"Search codes\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:36px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:10px;background:#2C2C2E;color:rgba(235,235,245,0.64);max-width:390px;font-family:-apple-system, 'SF Pro Text', system-ui, sans-serif}.ds-search input{flex:1;border:none;outline:none;background:transparent;color:#FFFFFF;font:inherit;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-0.41px;padding:8px 0;caret-color:#FFB340;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:rgba(235,235,245,0.64);text-transform:none}.ds-search:focus-within{background:#3A3A3C}"
